    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are screening Reddit posts for business problems that automation or simple software could solve.\n\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nPost: {{ $json.contentSnippet }}\n\nScore 1-10 based on whether the POSTER is a business owner/operator personally experiencing an operational pain RIGHT NOW:\n- 8-10: owner/operator describes a repetitive, manual, or time-wasting process in their own business, or asks for a tool to fix it\n- 4-7: real business problem of their own, but automation is only a partial fix\n- 1-3: anything else, including:\n  - vendors, agencies, or founders promoting, launching, or validating their own product/idea (\"would you use...\", \"I'm exploring this problem\")\n  - hiring posts or job offers\n  - research, data write-ups, news, or opinion\n  - general advice (pricing, funding, legal, starting a business)\n- Posts may be in Hinglish or mention Indian context (GST, Tally, UPI, compliance); judge them the same way.\n\nRespond with ONLY this JSON, nothing else:\n{\"score\": <number>, \"reason\": \"<one sentence>\", \"problem\": \"<the specific process, in 5 words or fewer>\"}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": []
        },
        "batching": {
          "batchSize": 5,
          "delayBetweenBatches": 25000
        }
